[en.FOCUS_C12_PIE_FAMILY_FUNERAL]
Funeral of the Pie Family

[en.FOCUS_C12_PIE_FAMILY_FUNERAL_desc]
ociation and must be held accountable for the chaos and scars inflicted upon Equestria over the past decade—especially those seared into Limestone Pie’s heart. Countless signed orders of approval are now piled like boulders atop the wooden desks of the temporary military administration, and Limestone Pie’s newly risen supporters carry out her every command in the region without hesitation or mercy.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_PIE_FAMILY_FUNERAL]
派家族的葬礼

[zh.FOCUS_C12_PIE_FAMILY_FUNERAL_desc]
几年前飞艇坠落的真相被分发和张贴到大街小巷，同时也记载着派家族为了保护其他小马免受帝国侵害所付出的多么惨痛的代价。很快，一个为火岩派和云母准备的大型公开葬礼将重新举办，而俩座用大理石雕刻的巨型欢笑元素雕像将会在仪式后被分别安置在坎特洛特和采石农场的广场上，用来提醒每一位路过的小马永远铭记这一点，并时刻保持对石青派的感激。

